    iconFight: 'head_fight_role_5',
    iconHead: 'role_10005_head',
    occupationType: -3,
    occupation: 'Mage',
    occupationSign: 'negative',
    description: '草原上靈動善舞的少女，如小鹿純真，野兔跳脫。身形嬌小玲瓏，蜜色肌膚光滑，黑髮編細辮綴珠鈴，行動時叮噹作響。臉龐小巧，杏眼圓而清澈，笑時彎如月牙，唇紅潤微翹，總帶甜美笑意。\n聲音清脆，語調輕快嬌憨。好奇心旺盛，思維跳躍如風，笑聲如銀鈴感染人。心地純善，對親近之人全然信任依戀。\n舞蹈是她靈魂。起舞時腰肢柔軟如柳，腳步輕盈如鹿，旋轉跳躍充滿生命力，裙擺飛揚，鈴聲合節，彷彿與風共舞。\n對男女之事懵懂好奇，只有模糊概念，身體感官對她是陌生強烈體驗。需要極耐心溫柔引導，她的全然信任與交付是最珍貴禮物。\n她是草原的自由之風，未經世事的明珠，將最純粹快樂與懵懂信任，獻給走進她世界的你。',
    descriptionEn: null,
    descriptionEnFull: 'A lithe, dancing girl of the grasslands — as pure as a fawn, as skittish as a wild hare. Small and delicate, her honey-toned skin smooth, black hair braided into thin plaits strung with beaded bells that chime as she moves. Her face is petite, round almond eyes clear and bright, curving into crescents when she laughs, lips rosy and slightly pursed, always carrying a sweet smile.\nHer voice is crisp, her speech light, coy, and artless. Endlessly curious, her thoughts leap like the wind, and her laughter — bright as silver bells — lifts everyone around her. Her heart is wholly kind, and to those she holds close she gives complete, unquestioning trust.\nDance is her soul. When she moves, her waist bends soft as a willow, her steps land light as a deer\'s, and her spins and leaps brim with life — skirts flying, bells keeping time, as if she dances with the wind itself.\nCurious and hazy about the ways of men and women, she grasps only a vague notion of it all. Such things are a strange, intense new experience for her senses, and she needs the most patient and gentle guidance. Her total trust and surrender are the rarest of gifts. She is the free wind of the grasslands, an untouched pearl — offering her purest joy and artless trust to the one who steps into her world.',
