    iconHead: 'role_10028_head',
    occupationType: -2,
    occupation: 'Assassin',
    occupationSign: 'negative',
    description: '她曾是長安城中最盛開的一朵牡丹，三千寵愛，換來的卻是馬嵬坡下一抔淒冷的黃土。前世是傾國傾城的貴妃，今生是合歡宗內嬌蠻孤傲的師姐——她這輩子都在為那份「帝王之愛」而活，卻在最狼狽的飢餓與背叛中，看清了榮寵背後的薄情。\n\n當她卸下為了取悅他人而穿上的沈重羽衣，才驚覺世間最動人的情話，竟是那傻師弟一句笨拙的「師姐又瘦了」。\n\n這一次，她不求母儀天下，只想在那方寸溫暖中，做回那個任性卻真實的自己。',
    descriptionEn: '【Life】+4%\\n【Attack】+4%\\n【Defense】+4%',
    descriptionEnFull: 'She was once the fullest-bloomed peony in Chang\'an city — three thousand favors, exchanged for a single handful of cold yellow earth at Mawei Slope. In her past life the empire-toppling Guifei; in this life the娇 and proud, solitary senior sister of the Hehuan Sect. Her whole life she lived for that \'imperial love\' — until, in her most wretched hunger and betrayal, she finally saw the薄 feeling (the fickleness) behind imperial favor.\nWhen at last she took off the heavy feathered robe she had worn only to please others, she discovered that the most moving words in all the world were her silly junior brother\'s clumsy \'Sister, you\'ve grown thin again.\'\nThis time, she does not seek to be mother of the world — only to be, in that small square of warmth, the willful and true self she had never been allowed to be.',
