      descriptions: ['Normal / Voidized state: releases Moon Blade Sky-Breaker / [Soul-Burn Skill] Dark Moon Blade Sky-Breaker — can re-appear 12 times; stores 4 / burns 18 soul-substance.', 'Void Release: every point of soul-substance stored/burned restores 29% max HP and costs 0.5% current HP. All-ally shield cap +150%. At 100 soul-substance, enters Voidization — loses 50% current HP and gains a full shield. During this, healing is deducted and converted to shield.', 'All heroes\' attack +20%, HP +20%, final damage +15%, damage reduction +5%.', 'War Soul Will: all allies take 20% less damage. Damage +30% per [War Soul] item gained in battle; gains 1 stack of [Spirit Pressure] (max 5), each stack +5% damage dealt and -5% damage taken. Every cumulative 45% max HP lost grants 1 stack of [Spirit Pressure] for 15s.'],
