    description: '她立如寒松映月，青絲素綰，眸似秋潭。聲若漱玉，語調從容，有經世之穩。前世踏碎玉門雪，調停胡漢兵戈，故萬事過眼皆雲煙。\n她待你總是目光溫潤，如春陽照雪。你精進時，她頷首不語；你行差時，她只輕拂袖，遞來清茶一盞。\n她總在你身側三尺，近可聞你氣息，遠不礙你鋒芒。\n夜深時，清冷氣韻化開。解散你道髻的指法暗合導引之術，相擁時道體初涼如玉，漸有暖意自丹田交融。唇齒間似飲寒潭深泉，靈韻暗渡。肌膚相親處，道韻流轉，將前世孤寂、今生執念，盡化入雙修妙境。\n她非絲蘿，是可並立之白樺。將塞外長風煉作胸中丘壑，就這樣靜立你道途旁，月升照影，風起障塵。',
    descriptionEn: null,
    descriptionEnFull: 'She stands like a cold pine silhouetted against the moon, black hair simply pinned, eyes deep as an autumn pool. Her voice is like jade rinsed in water, her speech unhurried, carrying the steadiness of one who has seen much. In her past life she crossed the snows beyond Jade Gate and brokered peace between the Hu and the Han — so now all worldly things pass her eyes like drifting clouds.\nShe always looks at you with a warm gaze, like spring sunlight on snow. When you progress, she nods without a word; when you stumble, she only flicks her sleeve and hands you a cup of clear tea.\nShe keeps herself three feet from your side — close enough to sense your breath, far enough never to hinder your edge. By her stands no clinging vine, only a white birch that grows beside you, moonlight for your shadow, windbreak for your dust.',
    basicEn: {
      name: 'Heart-Piercing Arrow',
      icon: 'skill_100001_1',
      descriptions: ['Fires a Heart-Piercing Arrow that pierces 1 time; gains 1 stack of [Blood Omen] and has 25% chance to inflict 1 stack of Bleed. In Underworld-Omen state, enhanced to the Black Demon Arrow.', 'Underworld Omen: at 15 Blood Omen stacks, enters Underworld-Omen state; in this state, every 10th attack consumes 15 Blood Omen stacks to release the Blood-Omen Skill [Underworld Demon Arrow], inflicts 5 stacks of Bleed, can ricochet across the screen.', 'All heroes\' attack +20%, HP +20%, final damage +15%, damage reduction +5%.', 'Blood Omen Resonance: damage +30% per [Bleed] item gained in battle; each item also boosts all allies\' Blood-Omen skill damage by 40%.'],
    },
    ultimateEn: {
      name: 'Awakening: God-Sealing Arrow',
      icon: 'skill_100001_2',
      descriptions: ['Attaches dark force to overawe and seal the enemy\'s mind — they cannot dodge; fires 5 God-Sealing Arrows that pierce 2 times.', 'Soul of Darkness: ① Heart-Piercing Arrow damage greatly increased; Black Demon Arrow release speed greatly increased. ② [Underworld Demon Arrow] fires 2 extra Phantom Demon Arrows. ③ All allies\' Blood-Omen skill cost -1 stack.'],
    },
    baseStats: { attack: 75, hp: 750, levelCap: 5, attackGrowth: 15, hpGrowth: 150 },
    skills: { basic: { name: '穿心矢', icon: 'skill_100001_1', descriptions: ['射出可穿透1次的穿心矢获得1层[血煞]，25%的概率给怪物1层[流血]。冥煞状态中，增强为黑魔矢', '冥煞:血煞达到15层时，进入冥煞状态，该状态下第10次攻击消耗15层血煞释放血煞技能[冥煞魔矢]。并给怪物5层流血，可弹射屏幕', '全部英雄攻击+20%，生命+20%，最终伤害+15%，伤害减免+5%', '血煞共鸣:战斗中每获得1件[流血1装备，伤害提升30%，每件可使全体友方血煞技能伤害提升40%'] }, ultimate: { name: '觉醒:封神矢', icon: 'skill_100001_2', descriptions: ['附着黑暗力量震慑封锁敌人心神让敌人无法躲避，发出5支可穿透2次的封神矢', '黑暗之魂:①穿心矢伤害大幅提升，黑魔矢释放速度大幅提升②[冥煞魔矢]额外发射2个幻影魔矢③全体友方血煞技能消耗血煞层数-1'] } },
