    occupationSign: 'positive',
    description: '她立如寒松映月，青絲素綰，眸似秋潭。聲若漱玉，語調從容，有經世之穩。前世踏碎玉門雪，調停胡漢兵戈，故萬事過眼皆雲煙。\n她待你總是目光溫潤，如春陽照雪。你精進時，她頷首不語；你行差時，她只輕拂袖，遞來清茶一盞。\n她總在你身側三尺，近可聞你氣息，遠不礙你鋒芒。\n夜深時，清冷氣韻化開。解散你道髻的指法暗合導引之術，相擁時道體初涼如玉，漸有暖意自丹田交融。唇齒間似飲寒潭深泉，靈韻暗渡。肌膚相親處，道韻流轉，將前世孤寂、今生執念，盡化入雙修妙境。\n她非絲蘿，是可並立之白樺。將塞外長風煉作胸中丘壑，就這樣靜立你道途旁，月升照影，風起障塵。',
    descriptionEn: null,
    descriptionEnFull: 'She stands like a cold pine silhouetted against the moon, black hair simply pinned, eyes deep as an autumn pool. Her voice is like jade rinsed in water, her speech unhurried, carrying the steadiness of one who has seen much. In her past life she crossed the snows beyond Jade Gate and brokered peace between the Hu and the Han — so now all worldly things pass her eyes like drifting clouds.\nShe always looks at you with a warm gaze, like spring sunlight on snow. When you progress, she nods without a word; when you stumble, she only flicks her sleeve and hands you a cup of clear tea.\nShe keeps herself three feet from your side — close enough to sense your breath, far enough never to hinder your edge. By her stands no clinging vine, only a white birch that grows beside you, moonlight for your shadow, windbreak for your dust.',
